// The hop names the concept. A disagreed concept does not land.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hop     ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1
CUBE concept ROLE observer PROTON 1

PLUG hop concept

IMPULSE hop 1
IMPULSE concept 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY concept
DECIDE concept
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "concepthop" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
